@Tindy.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5217
@accessToken = paste-your-access-token

### Health check
GET {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Register a local account
POST {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Tindy Test",
  "university": "FPT University",
  "email": "tindy-test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "accept_terms": true
}

### Log in, then copy data.access_token into accessToken above
POST {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "tindy-test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Current account
GET {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Onboarding draft
GET {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Step 1: Basic information
PUT {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tindy_test_01",
  "display_name": "Tindy Test",
  "university": "FPT University"
}

### Step 2: Skills
PUT {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding/2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"skills": [".NET", "AWS", "PostgreSQL"]}

### Step 3: Preferred role
PUT {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding/3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"preferred_role": "Backend Developer"}

### Step 4: Interests and goals
PUT {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding/4
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professional_interests": "Cloud computing",
  "learning_goals": "Build production-ready APIs"
}

### Step 5: Availability
PUT {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding/5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"available_hours_per_week": 10}

### Step 6: Project experience
PUT {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding/6
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "previous_projects_and_contribution": "Built an API",
  "technologies_to_learn": "Docker"
}

### Step 7: Optional links
PUT {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding/7
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"github_url": null, "personal_website_url": null}

### Step 8: Confirm profile completion; bio is optional
POST {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/onboarding/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmed": true}

### Development only: JWT authentication check
GET {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dev/auth-check
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Development only: Completed onboarding check
GET {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dev/onboarding-gate-check
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Log out
POST {{Tindy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
